{"id":"vista","lemma":"vista","pos":"noun","rank":555,"glosses":["sight, vision, eyesight (the ability to see)","sight (the act of seeing or witnessing)","appearance, look (the way something looks)"],"ipa":"/ˈbista/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"vistas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/0e/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-vista.wav","formAudio":{"vistas":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/4/46/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Emanuelps27-vistas.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Yo aparté la vista.","en":"I looked away.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/440322"},{"text":"Queremos una casa con vistas al mar.","en":"We want a house with a sea view.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/826107"},{"text":"Sal de mi vista.","en":"Get out of my sight.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/450531"},{"text":"Desearía una habitación con vistas al jardín.","en":"I'd like a room facing the garden.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/704679"},{"text":"Está a simple vista.","en":"It's in plain sight.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/75707"}]}